### Phase 3: API Endpoint Testing
### HTTP Client for IntelliJ IDEA
### Usage: Open this file in IntelliJ IDEA and click "Run" on each request

@base_url = http://localhost:8000
@content_type = application/json

### 3.1 Health Check
GET {{base_url}}/health

### 3.2 Generate QR Code for Login
GET {{base_url}}/auth/qrcode

### 3.3 Check Login Status
GET {{base_url}}/auth/status?qrcode_key=test_key

### 3.4 Get Video List
GET {{base_url}}/videos?page=1&page_size=20

### 3.5 Create Test Video
POST {{base_url}}/videos
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "bvid": "BV1234567890",
  "title": "Test Video",
  "description": "This is a test video",
  "duration": 600,
  "cover": "https://example.com/cover.jpg"
}

### 3.6 Get Video by ID
GET {{base_url}}/videos/BV1234567890

### 3.7 Search Subtitles
GET {{base_url}}/subtitles/search?keyword=test

### 3.8 Vector Search
POST {{base_url}}/search/vector
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "query": "B站推荐算法",
  "top_k": 5,
  "threshold": 0.7
}

### 3.9 Keyword Search
GET {{base_url}}/search/keyword?q=算法&limit=10

### 3.10 Hybrid Search
POST {{base_url}}/search/hybrid
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "query": "推荐系统",
  "top_k": 10,
  "keyword_weight": 0.3,
  "vector_weight": 0.7
}

### 3.11 Create Chat Session
POST {{base_url}}/chat/sessions
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "title": "B站视频讨论"
}

### 3.12 Send Chat Message
POST {{base_url}}/chat/sessions/1/messages
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "content": "B站推荐算法是怎样的？",
  "use_rag": true
}

### 3.13 Get Chat History
GET {{base_url}}/chat/sessions/1/messages

### 3.14 Get Task List
GET {{base_url}}/tasks?status=pending

### 3.15 Create Task
POST {{base_url}}/tasks
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{
  "task_type": "collect_favorites",
  "params": {
    "fav_id": 123456
  }
}

### 3.16 Get Task Details
GET {{base_url}}/tasks/1

### 3.17 Cancel Task
DELETE {{base_url}}/tasks/1

### 3.18 Error Case: Invalid Video ID
GET {{base_url}}/videos/invalid_id

### 3.19 Error Case: Missing Parameters
POST {{base_url}}/search/vector
Content-Type: {{content_type}}

{}

### 3.20 Error Case: Nonexistent Endpoint
GET {{base_url}}/nonexistent
